}

The compilation error in the previous submission was caused by incorrect syntax in the `ColumnFilter` property. In AL query objects, the `ColumnFilter` property requires specifying the column name being filtered, even when defined inside the `filter` element for that column. The syntax is `ColumnFilter = <ColumnName> = <FilterExpression>`.

The previous code used `ColumnFilter = const(Order);`, which caused the "identifier expected" error because the compiler expected the column name `Document_Type` before the filter value.

